\f1 \b0 \fs28 \pard \s3 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx3603 \tx3981 \tx4359 This category adds a single method to the Foundation framework\'27s NSCoder class. This method, \b decodeNXColor\b0 , is used to convert archived NXColors into NSColors. \
\fs14\
\fs28 NXColor, a type that dates from pre-OpenStep versions of NEXTSTEP, was a \b struct\b0 . Its replacement, NSColor, is a class. The difficulties of converting from a struct to a class require a special method like \b decodeNXColor\b0 .\
\fs14\
\pard \s46 \li2310 \fi-798 \ri1007 \ql \tx2308 \fs28 \f0 \b \fs24 Note:\tab \f1 \b0 \fs28 \b decodeNXColor\b0  becomes part of the NSCoder class only for applications that use the Application Kit.\
\fs14\
\fs28 \pard \s3 \li1512 \fi0 \ri1007 \ql \tx3603 \tx3981 \tx4359 For more information, see the NSCoder class specification in the \i Foundation Framework Reference\i0 .\
